   EExxaammppllee 11: Upgrading All ZFS Storage Pools to the Current Version
     The following command upgrades all ZFS Storage pools to the current ver‐
     sion of the software:
           # zzppooooll uuppggrraaddee --aa
           This system is currently running ZFS version 2.

